# Passive open with every option this stack understands. The SYN-ACK may only
# offer what the SYN offered (RFC 7323 1.3, RFC 2018 2), plus MSS; this stack
# advertises a window shift of 1.
0      listen 8080
+0     < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460,sackOK,TS val 100 ecr 0,nop,wscale 7>
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 65535 <mss 1460,sackOK,TS val * ecr 100,wscale 1>
+0.010 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 512 <nop,nop,TS val 110 ecr 1>
+0     accept
+0     state ESTABLISHED
